00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:38.950
- Well, I suppose I should have told you

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:40.190
in the first place.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:42.410
You see, I'd been working on that advertising campaign

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:43.250
with Lauren.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:44.530
Well, we'd been working so hard,

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.530
I just couldn't keep my eyes open.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.030
I didn't hear a note at the concert.

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:49.170
I fell asleep.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:51.230
- Next, he'll produce photographic evidence

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:52.150
of his dreams.

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:53.450
- I know it sounds suspicious,

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.330
but I'm resigned to that by now.

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.830
I'm a natural born suspect

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.960
just because I'm not the conventional type.

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.000
- I wouldn't worry about it,

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:09.380
carpenter sounds reasonable i fall asleep at concerts myself thank you you found that key yet

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:23.700
no i looked for it in the den but it wasn't there it may be in here here it is i knew there must be

00:14:23.700 --> 00:14:30.000
one around somewhere the police are very fussy about their inventories that key isn't on the list of

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.800
things that were in that drawer yesterday.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:34.290
