00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:56.950
Waldo, for your own good, I'm warning you to stop implying that I had anything to do with Laura's death.

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.830
Very well, I'll stop implying.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.950
- I'll make a direct statement. - All right, you ask what?

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:04.850
I wouldn't.

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:09.010
Will you please stop dawdling with that infernal puzzle?

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:12.930
- It's getting on my nerves. - I know, but it keeps me calm.

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:14.530
Okay, let's go.

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:31.860
This was our table.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:34.160
Laura's and mine.

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:38.350
We spent many quiet evenings here together.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:44.040
Remember we dined here the night before her 22nd birthday.

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:51.130
Just we two, happy, making plans for her future.

00:15:53.850 --> 00:16:00.000
But this was a far cry from the girl who walked into my life at the Algonquin Hotel five years

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:24.200
before excuse me lie decker how do you do my name is laura hunt and i'm with bullock and company

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:29.190
you know the big advertising firm and i'd like to talk something over with you if i may

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:36.730
hardly fail to realize that I'm engaged in eating my lunch. Yes, I know. I'm awfully sorry to interrupt

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:42.130
this way, but it's so hard to get to see you the regular way, and this will only take a minute,

