00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:30.000
In my case, self-absorption is...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:35.220
completely justified. I have never discovered any other subject quite so worthy of my attention.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:43.680
But you're right about people with such real understanding and sentiment. That's what makes

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:51.390
your column so good. The sentiment comes easily at fifty cents a word. Well, if that's the way you

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:59.510
