00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.260
You're a poor man.

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:05.370
I'm very sorry for you.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:10.860
Actually, I was annoyed by the incident.

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:14.540
But she had something about her, that girl.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:17.610
I had to speak to her again.

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:20.080
I had to see her.

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:21.780
Miss, would you mind if I...

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:22.760
Just a moment, please.

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:24.340
