00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.830
Boy, Waldo Lydecker to see Miss Laura Hunt.

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:55.140
Announce me.

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:58.920
Johnny, please tell the gentleman I'm busy.

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:07.650
Miss Hunt, I have something to say to you.

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:09.510
