01:00:05.560 --> 01:00:30.000
morning. Good morning. Breakfast. You didn't buy any food when you went out last night. I'll pick some bacon and eggs. Can you make coffee? Suppose you set the table while I get breakfast. Do you always sound like this?

01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:30.850
Good morning.

01:00:30.850 --> 01:00:33.090
Don't tell me you can cook.

01:00:33.090 --> 01:00:36.090
