01:01:57.740 --> 01:02:00.000
own free will. Redfern was in

01:02:00.000 --> 01:02:29.640
love with Carpenter. You admitted that last night. May I have a match, please? Oh, I'm sorry. I also told you that he wasn't in love with her. Just sit still. Hello, Lieutenant. Good morning, my darling. Hello, dear. Thank you. Oh.

01:02:30.120 --> 01:02:31.320
