01:02:50.180 --> 01:02:51.980
Besides, none of it was true.

01:02:51.980 --> 01:02:54.170
- Smart lawyer you've got, Carpenter.

01:02:54.170 --> 01:02:56.230
Maybe he told you how that scotch got up here Friday night

01:02:56.230 --> 01:02:57.950
after you'd bought it at Moscone's.

01:02:57.950 --> 01:03:00.000
Maybe it was the lawyer who brought Diane Redfern up here.

01:03:00.320 --> 01:03:11.620
