01:13:32.010 --> 01:13:33.140
Are you in love with him?

01:13:33.140 --> 01:13:40.180
I don't see how I ever could have been.

01:13:40.180 --> 01:13:46.650
No.

01:13:46.650 --> 01:13:52.630
That's what I wanted you to think.

01:13:52.630 --> 01:13:54.460
You and a few others.

01:13:54.460 --> 01:13:56.090
I didn't even book you.

01:13:56.090 --> 01:13:58.520
You mean this was some sort of a game?

01:13:58.520 --> 01:14:00.000
I was 99%, sir.

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:07.360
about you, but I had to get rid of that one percent doubt. Wasn't there an easier way to make sure?

01:14:07.360 --> 01:14:20.070
Reached a point where I needed official surroundings. Then it was worth it, Mark. I'll call a cab before you.

01:14:33.680 --> 01:14:35.600
Good night. I'll see you tomorrow.

01:14:35.600 --> 01:14:36.630
Good night.

01:14:36.630 --> 01:14:42.800
I'm going over to Lidecker's apartment.

01:16:04.120 --> 01:16:06.170
It still doesn't make sense to me, Laura.

01:16:06.170 --> 01:16:07.910
He's playing some sort of a game with you.

01:16:07.910 --> 01:16:10.020
I don't think so.

01:16:10.020 --> 01:16:15.000
I don't deny that he's infatuated with you in some warped way of his own.

01:16:15.000 --> 01:16:18.680
But he isn't capable of any normal, warm, human relationship.

01:16:18.680 --> 01:16:21.820
He's been dealing with criminals too long.

01:16:21.820 --> 01:16:26.660
Only you were unattainable when he thought you were dead.

01:16:26.660 --> 01:16:28.320
That's when he wanted you most.

01:16:28.320 --> 01:16:30.000
But he was glad when I came back.

01:16:30.830 --> 01:16:32.170
As if he were waiting for me.

01:16:32.930 --> 01:16:34.230
Do you know what he calls women?

01:16:34.980 --> 01:16:35.340
Dame.

01:16:36.400 --> 01:16:39.020
